From: Christian Bruel <christian.bruel@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 11:23:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: add tcpp pinctrl entries for stm32mp25

Add pinctrl entries related to TCPP03 GPIO in stm32mp25-pinctrl.dtsi

Change-Id: I1cde7945b3de1799ab2826b8d0468825597debe7
Signed-off-by: Christian Bruel <christian.bruel@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/581847
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp25-pinctrl.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp25-pinctrl.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp25-pinctrl.dtsi
index 447efa0a20fa..691fd8707049 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp25-pinctrl.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp25-pinctrl.dtsi
@@ -925,6 +925,14 @@ pins1 {
 		};
 	};
 
+	/omit-if-no-ref/
+	tcpp_flgn_pins_a: tcpp-flgn-0 {
+		pins {
+			pinmux = <STM32_PINMUX('G', 1, GPIO)>;
+			bias-pull-up;
+		};
+	};
+
 	/omit-if-no-ref/
 	tim10_counter_pins_a: tim10-counter-0 {
 		pins {
-- 
